<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>离线开发环境安装指南 · {{BUNDLE_NAME}}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #eef2f7;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --ink: #0f172a;
    --muted: #5b6678;
    --line: #e2e8f0;
    --brand: #2563eb;
    --brand-2: #7c3aed;
    --ok: #16a34a;
    --code-bg: #0d1117;
    --code-line: #30363d;
    --code-ink: #e6edf3;
    --radius: 18px;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC",
                 "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.65;
    background:
      radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% -10%, #dbeafe 0%, transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(900px 500px at 100% 0%, #ede9fe 0%, transparent 50%),
      var(--bg);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  .page { max-width: 940px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px 72px; }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 44px 40px 38px;
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #2563eb 48%, #7c3aed 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px -24px rgba(37, 99, 235, .6);
  }
  .hero::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background:
      radial-gradient(420px 200px at 85% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,.22), transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(300px 160px at 0% 100%, rgba(255,255,255,.14), transparent 70%);
  }
  .hero > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .18em;
    opacity: .8;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    margin: 10px 0 8px;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.15rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
  }
  .lead { margin: 0; font-size: 1.02rem; opacity: .92; max-width: 620px; }
  .badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 22px; }
  .badge {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }

  .card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 28px 30px;
    margin-top: 22px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15,23,42,.04), 0 10px 30px -22px rgba(15,23,42,.35);
  }
  .card h2 {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-size: 1.18rem;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
  }
  .step-dot {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex: none;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-2));
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .card h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }

  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; font-size: .94rem; }
  th, td { padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  th {
    font-size: .76rem;
    letter-spacing: .07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    background: #f8fafc;
  }
  tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }

  code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, "SF Mono", Consolas,
                 "Liberation Mono", monospace;
    font-size: .88em;
  }
  p code, li code, td code {
    background: #eff3f9;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: .12em .42em;
  }
  td code { white-space: nowrap; }

  .step { margin-top: 22px; }
  .step:first-of-type { margin-top: 14px; }
  .step-head { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .step-badge {
    flex: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #eff6ff;
    border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
    color: #1d4ed8;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .step-head p { margin: 2px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .92rem; }

  .codeblock {
    background: var(--code-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--code-line);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }
  .codebar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    background: #161b22;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--code-line);
  }
  .code-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8b949e;
  }
  .copy-btn {
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #c9d1d9;
    background: #21262d;
    border: 1px solid #3d444d;
    border-radius: 7px;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background .18s, color .18s, border-color .18s, transform .1s;
  }
  .copy-btn:hover { background: #30363d; color: #fff; }
  .copy-btn:active { transform: scale(.97); }
  .copy-btn.copied {
    color: #3fb950;
    border-color: #238636;
    background: rgba(35,134,54,.16);
  }
  .codeblock pre { margin: 0; padding: 14px 16px; overflow-x: auto; }
  .codeblock code {
    color: var(--code-ink);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    white-space: pre;
  }

  .tip {
    background: #fffbeb;
    border: 1px solid #fde68a;
    border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    font-size: .92rem;
    color: #7c4a03;
  }
  .tip strong { color: #92400e; }

  ul.checks { margin: 10px 0 0; padding-left: 0; list-style: none; }
  ul.checks li { position: relative; padding-left: 24px; margin: 7px 0; font-size: .94rem; }
  ul.checks li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    color: var(--ok);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  footer {
    margin-top: 30px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: .82rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .page { padding: 20px 12px 48px; }
    .hero { padding: 30px 24px; border-radius: 18px; }
    .card { padding: 22px 18px; }
    th, td { padding: 8px; }
  }
  @media print {
    body { background: #fff; }
    .hero { box-shadow: none; }
    .card { box-shadow: none; break-inside: avoid; }
    .copy-btn { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">OFFLINE DEVCONTAINER</div>
    <h1>离线开发环境安装指南</h1>
    <p class="lead">解压 → 安装 → 启动，全部步骤均可在内网离线完成。每条命令都可一键复制。</p>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="badge">bundle {{TS}}</span>
      <span class="badge">镜像 TAG {{TAG}}</span>
      <span class="badge">4 个文件</span>
      <span class="badge">无需联网</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>

    <section class="card">
      <h2><span class="step-dot">01</span>包内文件</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <tr><th>#</th><th>文件</th><th>说明</th></tr>
          <tr><td>1</td><td><code>devcontainer-docker-images_{{ARCH}}_{{TS}}.tgz</code></td><td>镜像归档（docker load 用）</td></tr>
          <tr><td>2</td><td><code>devcontainer-src_{{ARCH}}_{{TS}}.tgz</code></td><td>源码 / 模板包</td></tr>
          <tr><td>3</td><td><code>install.sh</code></td><td>安装脚本</td></tr>
          <tr><td>4</td><td><code>readme.html</code></td><td>本说明</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="muted">解压后 4 个文件应位于同一目录（推荐项目根目录的 <code>dist/</code>）。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2><span class="step-dot">02</span>准备安装包</h2>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-head">
          <span class="step-badge">1</span>
          <div>
            <h3>在项目根目录创建 dist/</h3>
            <p>后续所有解压与安装命令都在该目录中执行。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="codeblock">
          <div class="codebar"><span class="code-label">项目根目录</span><button class="copy-btn" type="button" aria-label="复制命令">复制</button></div>
          <pre><code>mkdir -p dist</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-head">
          <span class="step-badge">2</span>
          <div>
            <h3>把安装包移入 dist/</h3>
            <p>如果 zip 已经在 <code>dist/</code> 中，可跳过此步。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="codeblock">
          <div class="codebar"><span class="code-label">项目根目录</span><button class="copy-btn" type="button" aria-label="复制命令">复制</button></div>
          <pre><code>mv {{BUNDLE_NAME}}.zip dist/</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-head">
          <span class="step-badge">3</span>
          <div>
            <h3>进入 dist/</h3>
            <p>安装脚本需要和两个 tgz 位于同一目录。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="codeblock">
          <div class="codebar"><span class="code-label">项目根目录</span><button class="copy-btn" type="button" aria-label="复制命令">复制</button></div>
          <pre><code>cd dist</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-head">
          <span class="step-badge">4</span>
          <div>
            <h3>解压安装包</h3>
            <p>解压出的 4 个文件与 zip 同级。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="codeblock">
          <div class="codebar"><span class="code-label">dist/</span><button class="copy-btn" type="button" aria-label="复制命令">复制</button></div>
          <pre><code>unzip {{BUNDLE_NAME}}.zip</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2><span class="step-dot">03</span>安装</h2>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-head">
          <span class="step-badge">1</span>
          <div>
            <h3>一键安装并导入镜像（推荐）</h3>
            <p><code>--load</code> 会在安装开始前自动查找并 <code>docker load</code> 同目录的镜像归档，一步到位。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="codeblock">
          <div class="codebar"><span class="code-label">dist/ · 推荐</span><button class="copy-btn" type="button" aria-label="复制命令">复制</button></div>
          <pre><code>bash install.sh --load ../</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-head">
          <span class="step-badge">2</span>
          <div>
            <h3>或分步安装（不使用 --load）</h3>
            <p>先执行安装，再手动导入镜像归档。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="codeblock">
          <div class="codebar"><span class="code-label">dist/ · 安装</span><button class="copy-btn" type="button" aria-label="复制命令">复制</button></div>
          <pre><code>bash install.sh ../</code></pre>
        </div>
        <div class="codeblock">
          <div class="codebar"><span class="code-label">dist/ · 导入镜像</span><button class="copy-btn" type="button" aria-label="复制命令">复制</button></div>
          <pre><code>docker load -i devcontainer-docker-images_{{ARCH}}_{{TS}}.tgz</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-head">
          <span class="step-badge">3</span>
          <div>
            <h3>查看完整帮助</h3>
            <p>随时查看用法、选项与退出码。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="codeblock">
          <div class="codebar"><span class="code-label">dist/ · 帮助</span><button class="copy-btn" type="button" aria-label="复制命令">复制</button></div>
          <pre><code>bash install.sh -h</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tip">
        <strong>安装前须知：</strong>项目根目录若已存在 <code>Makefile</code>、<code>build.sh</code>、
        <code>Dockerfile</code> 或 <code>docker-compose.yml</code>，安装会终止且不会覆盖；
        请先移动或重命名这些文件。
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2><span class="step-dot">04</span>启动</h2>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-head">
          <span class="step-badge">1</span>
          <div>
            <h3>回到项目根目录</h3>
            <p>所有 make 与 build.sh 命令都在项目根目录执行。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="codeblock">
          <div class="codebar"><span class="code-label">dist/</span><button class="copy-btn" type="button" aria-label="复制命令">复制</button></div>
          <pre><code>cd ..</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-head">
          <span class="step-badge">2</span>
          <div>
            <h3>环境自检</h3>
            <p>确认 compose 文件、镜像与目录是否就绪。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="codeblock">
          <div class="codebar"><span class="code-label">项目根目录</span><button class="copy-btn" type="button" aria-label="复制命令">复制</button></div>
          <pre><code>make check</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-head">
          <span class="step-badge">3</span>
          <div>
            <h3>启动服务</h3>
            <p>后台启动应用及依赖服务。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="codeblock">
          <div class="codebar"><span class="code-label">项目根目录</span><button class="copy-btn" type="button" aria-label="复制命令">复制</button></div>
          <pre><code>make up</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-head">
          <span class="step-badge">4</span>
          <div>
            <h3>查看日志</h3>
            <p>确认服务已正常启动。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="codeblock">
          <div class="codebar"><span class="code-label">项目根目录</span><button class="copy-btn" type="button" aria-label="复制命令">复制</button></div>
          <pre><code>make logs</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2><span class="step-dot">05</span>install.sh 做了什么</h2>
      <ul class="checks">
        <li>解压 src 包到 <code>&lt;项目根&gt;/docs/devcontainer</code>（原始文件副本，仅用于把改坏的根目录文件复制回去重置）。</li>
        <li>把 <code>Makefile</code> / <code>build.sh</code> / <code>Dockerfile</code> / <code>README-devcontainer.md</code> / <code>.dockerignore</code> / <code>.gitignore</code> 安装到项目根目录，已存在同名文件时终止安装。</li>
        <li>复制 compose 模板到项目根目录为 <code>docker-compose.yml</code>。</li>
        <li>创建 <code>wheels/requirements.txt</code> 离线安装头，把 wheel 放进 <code>wheels/</code> 后即可离线安装 Python 包。</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="muted">详细说明见项目根目录的 <code>README-devcontainer.md</code>（与 <code>docs/devcontainer/README.md</code> 内容一致）。</p>
    </section>
{{AGENT_HTML_SECTION}}{{ORACLE_SECTION}}{{NPM_SECTION}}
  </main>

  <footer>
    镜像 TAG: {{TAG}} · 完整手册见仓库 docs/offline-devcontainer.md
  </footer>

</div>

<script>
(function () {
  function fallbackCopy(text) {
    var ta = document.createElement('textarea');
    ta.value = text;
    ta.setAttribute('readonly', '');
    ta.style.position = 'fixed';
    ta.style.top = '-1000px';
    ta.style.opacity = '0';
    document.body.appendChild(ta);
    ta.select();
    try { document.execCommand('copy'); } catch (e) { /* 忽略 */ }
    document.body.removeChild(ta);
  }

  function markCopied(btn) {
    btn.textContent = '已复制';
    btn.classList.add('copied');
    clearTimeout(btn._copyTimer);
    btn._copyTimer = setTimeout(function () {
      btn.textContent = '复制';
      btn.classList.remove('copied');
    }, 1600);
  }

  var buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.copy-btn');
  for (var i = 0; i < buttons.length; i++) {
    buttons[i].addEventListener('click', function () {
      var block = this.closest('.codeblock');
      var code = block ? block.querySelector('code') : null;
      if (!code) { return; }
      var text = code.innerText.replace(/\s+$/, '');
      var btn = this;
      // 先给出“已复制”反馈，再异步写入剪贴板；写入失败时回退到 execCommand
      markCopied(btn);
      try {
        if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {
          navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).catch(function () {
            fallbackCopy(text);
          });
        } else {
          fallbackCopy(text);
        }
      } catch (e) {
        fallbackCopy(text);
      }
    });
  }
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
